Path\(id\): Timing\(ns\)/Thread cycles/Instrs/Fnops/Pausable/Executions/Absolute
\+COMPLETE \[2 path\(s\)\]
    path\(\d+\) +: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/0/1/0
        \+loop \[1 path\(s\)\, 0 iteration\(s\)\]
            path\(\d+\) +: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/0/0/0
    path\(\d+\) +: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/0/1/0
        \+loop \[1 path\(s\)\, 0 iteration\(s\)\]
            path\(\d+\) +: \d+\.\d+/\d+/\d+/\d+/0/0/0
